 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Straw Doll Technique — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>Once you reach 6th level, you learn a new way to damage your enemies. When you launch a <em>Nail Projectile</em> and hit a creature or as a bonus action for 1 Cursed Energy, you can stick a nail into an object. If hitting a creature, the initial attack deals no damage. As a bonus action or as a reaction to a creature coming within 5 feet of the nail, you can create cursed explosions. Creatures within 10 feet of the nails must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take 1d8 necrotic damage for each nail, taking half as much damage on a success. You can spend additional Cursed Energy when you drive the nail, increasing the damage by 1d8 for every additional Cursed Energy spent.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
